flowchart LR
    %% Styles for DFD
    classDef process fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px,rx:10,ry:10;
    classDef store fill:#eee,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px,shape:cylinder;
    classDef entity fill:#bbf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px,shape:rect;

    %% Entities
    User[安全工程师]:::entity
    Expert[专家评审]:::entity
    
    %% Processes
    P1(1. 漏洞载入):::process
    P2(2. 策略生成):::process
    P3(3. 人工评审):::process
    P4(4. 策略排序):::process
    P5(5. 审计归档):::process

    %% Data Stores
    D1[(CVE 知识库)]:::store
    D2[(策略库)]:::store
    D3[(排序记录)]:::store

    %% Flows
    User -->|导入 CVE| P1
    P1 -->|提取特征| P2
    D1 -.->|检索语料| P2
    P2 -->|候选策略| D2
    
    D2 -.->|读取生成结果| P3
    Expert -->|提交评语| P3
    P3 -->|反馈优化| P2
    
    P3 -->|评审通过| P4
    Expert -->|排序指令| P4
    P4 -->|最终排名| P5
    P5 -->|持久化| D3